This directory contains the following Elan programs:

CALC         A pocket calculator Hewlet-Packard style.
EULER        Numerical example.
HANOI        Recursion & simple graphics. The towers of hanoi.
NFAC         Calculating n! with large precision.
NQUEENS      Recursion. The n queens problem.
PRIMES       Searching for prime numbers.
RACE         Game, used in the example session in the manual.
RANTEST      Numerical example, testing the random generator.
REVERSE      Recursion. Testing for palindromes
SHOWASC      Example showing character-set.
SIEVE        Searching for primes using the sieve of Erasthotenes.
SINE         Numerical example.
THERAPY      Standard program simulating a psychiatrist; read with 'p'.
